# Gateway (`apps/gateway`)

Biome (2-space, double quotes, semicolons, trailing commas). Alias `~/*` →
`src/*`. `import type` required (`verbatimModuleSyntax`).

## Boundaries

- Parse untrusted input with Zod at the edge; `z.infer` the type. `safeParse`
  when you own the error message. Never `z.coerce.boolean()` for env flags —
  use `boolFromEnv` in `src/config.ts`.
- Throw `HTTPException` for expected 4xx. Unexpected errors stay
  `{ error: { code: "INTERNAL", message: "Internal server error" } }` — no
  internals in the body. Error codes are API contract.
- Log structured objects through Pino; redaction already covers
  `authorization` and `cookie`. Never log secrets or full env.
- Call OpenFang only via `tracedFetch` / `getTraceHeaders()`. Do not retry
  POST dispatch or re-POST an SSE stream after disconnect. Berry mints run IDs;
  OpenFang has no issue-correlated run resource.
- Memory KV and workflow-runs on the pinned commit ignore `{id}` — prefix and
  filter in Berry.

## Schema

- Issue numbers: atomic `boards.issue_counter` in the same transaction as insert.
- `assignee_type` + `assignee_id` both-or-neither. Zod-validate `boards.columns`
  on write. Same-issue comment threads are app-validated, not DB-enforced.
- `docs/api/gateway-v1.md` is the public shape (`camelCase`); DB names are not
  the API.

## Tests

`bun run typecheck && bun run lint && bun test`. Drive `createApp()` with
`app.request`. Skip when `DATABASE_URL` is unset. Co-locate `*.test.ts` or use
`tests/`.
